@startuml 反熵同步机制时序图
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 20
skinparam maxmessagesize 60
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline

title Consul 反熵同步机制时序图

participant "应用程序" as App
participant "Agent" as Agent
participant "local.State" as LocalState
participant "ae.StateSyncer" as Syncer
participant "Trigger" as Trigger
participant "Consul集群" as Cluster
participant "定时器" as Timer

== 初始化阶段 ==

Agent -> LocalState: NewState(config, logger, tokens)
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/local/state.go:225\n创建本地状态管理器

Agent -> Syncer: NewStateSyncer(state, interval, shutdownCh, logger)
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/ae/ae.go:120\n创建反熵同步器

Syncer -> Trigger: NewTrigger() x2
note right: 创建 SyncFull 和 SyncChanges 触发器

Agent -> Syncer: StartSync()
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/agent.go:1972\n启动同步协程

Syncer -> Syncer: Run()
note right: 启动状态机\n初始状态: fullSyncState

== 全量同步流程 ==

Syncer -> Syncer: nextFSMState(fullSyncState)
note right: 状态机处理全量同步

Syncer -> LocalState: SyncFull()
note right: 执行全量同步

LocalState -> LocalState: 比较本地和远程状态
note right: 检查所有服务和检查项

LocalState -> Cluster: RPC("Catalog.List")
note right: 获取远程状态

Cluster -> LocalState: 返回远程服务列表

LocalState -> LocalState: diffServices(local, remote)
note right: 计算差异

loop 对每个需要同步的服务
    LocalState -> Cluster: RPC("Catalog.Register", service)
    note right: 注册/更新服务
    
    Cluster -> LocalState: 返回成功
    
    LocalState -> LocalState: 标记服务已同步
    note right: service.InSync = true
end

Syncer -> Syncer: 转换到 partialSyncState
note right: 全量同步完成\n进入增量同步状态

== 服务变更触发增量同步 ==

App -> Agent: AddService(serviceReq)
note right: 应用程序注册新服务

Agent -> LocalState: AddServiceWithChecks(service, checks, token, locallyRegistered)
note right: 添加到本地状态

LocalState -> LocalState: 更新服务映射
note right: services[serviceID] = serviceState\nservice.InSync = false

LocalState -> Trigger: TriggerSyncChanges()
note right: 触发增量同步

Trigger -> Trigger: 非阻塞发送信号
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/ae/trigger.go:17\nselect/default 模式

Syncer -> Syncer: syncChangesEvent()
note right: 等待同步事件

Trigger -> Syncer: 收到 syncChangesNotifEvent
note right: 增量同步触发

Syncer -> LocalState: SyncChanges()
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/local/state.go:1245\n执行增量同步

LocalState -> LocalState: 遍历未同步的服务
note right: for id, s := range l.services {\n  if !s.InSync { ... }

LocalState -> Cluster: RPC("Catalog.Register", newService)
note right: 只同步变更的服务

Cluster -> LocalState: 返回成功

LocalState -> LocalState: 标记服务已同步
note right: service.InSync = true

== 健康检查状态变更 ==

Agent -> Agent: 健康检查执行
note right: HTTP/TCP/TTL 检查

Agent -> LocalState: UpdateCheck(checkID, status, output)
note right: 更新检查状态

LocalState -> LocalState: 更新检查映射
note right: checks[checkID].Status = status\ncheck.InSync = false

LocalState -> Trigger: TriggerSyncChanges()
note right: 触发增量同步

Syncer -> LocalState: SyncChanges()
note right: 同步检查状态变更

LocalState -> Cluster: RPC("Catalog.Register", checkUpdate)
note right: 同步健康检查状态

== 定时全量同步 ==

Timer -> Timer: 定时器到期
note right: 默认间隔 + 错峰延迟

Timer -> Syncer: syncFullTimerEvent
note right: 定时全量同步事件

Syncer -> Syncer: 转换到 fullSyncState
note right: 状态机切换

Syncer -> Syncer: resetNextFullSyncCh()
note right: 重置下次全量同步时间\n应用错峰延迟

== 集群变更触发全量同步 ==

Cluster -> Agent: 新服务器加入通知
note right: Serf 成员变更事件

Agent -> Trigger: SyncFull.Trigger()
note right: 触发立即全量同步

Trigger -> Syncer: syncFullNotifEvent
note right: 全量同步通知事件

Syncer -> Syncer: 应用错峰延迟
note right: stagger(serverUpInterval)\n避免雷群效应

Syncer -> Syncer: 转换到 fullSyncState
note right: 执行全量同步

== 同步失败重试 ==

Syncer -> LocalState: SyncFull()
note right: 尝试全量同步

LocalState -> Cluster: RPC("Catalog.Register", service)
note right: 同步请求

Cluster -> LocalState: 返回错误
note right: 网络错误或服务器故障

LocalState -> Syncer: 返回同步错误

Syncer -> Syncer: 转换到 retryFullSyncState
note right: 进入重试状态

Syncer -> Syncer: retrySyncFullEvent()
note right: 等待重试事件

Timer -> Syncer: 重试定时器到期
note right: 指数退避延迟

Syncer -> Syncer: 转换到 fullSyncState
note right: 重新尝试全量同步

== 暂停和恢复同步 ==

Agent -> Syncer: Pause()
note right: 暂停同步\n通常在配置重载时

Syncer -> Syncer: paused++
note right: 增加暂停计数

App -> Agent: 批量操作
note right: 大量服务注册/注销

Agent -> Syncer: Resume()
note right: 恢复同步

Syncer -> Syncer: paused--
note right: 减少暂停计数

alt paused == 0
    Syncer -> Trigger: SyncChanges.Trigger()
    note right: 触发同步恢复后的变更
end

== 优雅关闭 ==

Agent -> Syncer: 发送关闭信号
note right: close(shutdownCh)

Syncer -> Syncer: 收到 shutdownEvent
note right: 状态机收到关闭事件

Syncer -> Syncer: 转换到 doneState
note right: 状态机结束

Syncer -> Syncer: 清理资源
note right: 停止所有协程和定时器

note over App, Cluster
    反熵同步机制特点:
    1. 自动检测和修复数据不一致
    2. 支持全量和增量两种同步模式
    3. 错峰同步避免雷群效应
    4. 非阻塞触发机制
    5. 状态机管理同步流程
    6. 指数退避重试机制
    7. 支持暂停和恢复
end note

@enduml
